  "details": "Hello, my name is mittsu_.\n\nI’ll get right to the point: after taking a photo in VRChat, my FPS drops dramatically, and I can no longer play normally.\n\nIs this a problem with my PC, or is it a bug in VRChat?\n\nI play VRChat in VR, and while I can consistently maintain an average of 30 FPS or higher in any world without any lag, after taking a photo, my FPS drops to around 5–10 FPS and won’t recover unless I restart the game.\n\nAlso, this seems to happen only in VR mode.\n\nMy PC specs are:\n\nCore i7-10700kf\n\n64 GB RAM\n\nRadeon RT9070XT\n\nThank you in advance.",
